  "Vulnerabilities": [
    {
      "CVE": "CVE-2026-115943",
      "Description": "Spreadsheet::XLSX versions before 0.19 for Perl allow code execution via string eval of number format conditions in ExcelFmt.\n\nWhen a number format has a condition such as [\u003e100], ExcelFmt chooses the format section by passing the condition and the cell value to a string eval. Both come from the workbook, and the eval runs while Spreadsheet::XLSX-\u003enew parses it.\n\nAn attacker who supplies an XLSX file can run arbitrary Perl code.",
